    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><u>CASE 1:</u></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><u>CASE 2:</u></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>